  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing sustainable and inclusive local food production and market systems for household resilience (Umusaruro mwiza, iterambere kuri bose)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the action is to contribute to ensuring food security in Rwanda, though more resilient food systems covering sustainable food production, processing, marketing and consumption.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Outcome: Boost food production and availability in local markets, ensuring sustainable food chain and inclusive farming value chains in Rwanda.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Project Outputs;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Smallholders and women cooperatives improve their crop and livestock production and productivity, for sustainable food access and availability, and with a value chain approach.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Women cooperatives strengthen their capacities for post-harvest and livestock management: storage, processing and packaging, increasing added-value of local production.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Smallholders and women producers (cooperatives) improve their economic resilience and entrepreneurial capacity to overcome barriers to access marketing networks and processing chains.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Households and local authorities improve their knowledge and practices related to locally produced healthier food consumption and circular economy opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
